  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bfcb709b487afd749b8fbd2c4c50e261, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CardDungeon::Assets.Scripts.Heroes.HeroSO
  Key: Mage
  Label: Mage
  Blurb: Commands fire, frost and storm, and is rarely careful about which.
  Vision:
    Fantasy: 'An elemental mage, found walled up in the Sealed Archive. Commands
      storm, frost and fire, and is rarely careful about which. DRAFT by Claude
      2026-10-07 - the owner''s to rewrite.'
    Role: 'Intelligence caster: elemental damage, area hits and the tag combos
      (Freeze in his own frost branch, Ignite with the Tinkerer''s oil), plus the
      self-cast cloaks that answer an elemental floor.'
    SignatureMechanic: 'Focus and MultiCast: he builds Focus during combat (how exactly
      is not decided yet) and spends it to double-cast, triple-cast or even quadruple-cast.
      MultiCast is both his signature and his Ultra.'
    UltraStyle: MultiCast
    Ultras:
    - Name: MultiCast
      Effect: Spend Focus to cast the next ability 2, 3 or 4 times (double-, triple-,
        quadruple-cast). A rough idea; the details are not decided.
      Unlock: Signature (trunk)
    Branches:
    - GridBranch: a
      Becomes: 'Storm: speed and reach.'
      IntendedKit: Storm Cloak -> Chain Lightning
      Summon: 
    - GridBranch: b
      Becomes: 'Frost and water: Freeze on his own, and the sturdier body.'
      IntendedKit: Ice Shard -> Water Splash -> Frost Cloak
      Summon: 
    - GridBranch: c
      Becomes: 'Fire: the Ashen Deep''s answer first (Fire Cloak at the third node),
        then the blast.'
      IntendedKit: Fire Cloak -> Fireball
      Summon: 
    Overlaps: 'Warlock and Cultist are Intelligence casters too, but shadow and
      blood; the Mage owns the elements.'
    OpenQuestions: 'How Focus is built (per cast? per turn? per element switch?) and
      how much each tier costs. Is MultiCast spent through the shared Ultra gauge, or
      does Focus replace the gauge for him? Is Chain Lightning the right storm capstone?
      Summons per branch are Claude drafts in the hero workbook. Working name ''Mage''.'
